Dialogue: 10,0:00:03.39,0:00:08.86,Default,Narr,0,0,0,,The skies of Kyoto, long famed \Nfor their splendor, burned red.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:09.62,0:00:13.15,Default,Narr,0,0,0,,The Miyoshi Three, who had been \Nexpanding their power around Kyoto,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.57,0:00:17.24,Default,Narr,0,0,0,,had attacked the Ashikaga Dictatorship.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.99,0:00:23.25,Default,Narr,0,0,0,,For their ruler, the highest ranking samurai of them all, being attacked was unprecedented.{This line and the next are probably three-liners now, but I couldn't stand the stupid way they were timed. Please split this line sensibly. -GBF}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.93,0:00:29.75,Default,Narr,0,0,0,,Thus, the Muromachi shogunate collapsed after ruling the samurai society for 240 years.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.41,0:00:36.01,Default,Narr,0,0,0,,The turbulent Sengoku Era was \Nabout to enter a new age.
