Dialogue: 2,0:02:09.40,0:02:12.82,Ep Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(488,431)\bord2.25\3a&80&\fsp3\an7\blur3\b1\3c&H595959&\i0\fscx82\fscy90\pos(976.001,403)}Episode Seven\NNobuna Advances\N on Kyoto
Dialogue: 10,0:02:10.51,0:02:12.40,Default,N,0,0,0,,This is terrible!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:12.93,0:02:16.28,Default,N,0,0,0,,There goes my plan to march on the \Ncapital under the Ashikaga's banner!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:16.67,0:02:18.50,Default,S,0,0,0,,Even if the ruling Ashikaga have been assassinated,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:18.50,0:02:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,there's still their brother, Yoshiaki.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.62,0:02:23.36,Default,S,0,0,0,,If you make him the new ruler,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:23.36,0:02:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll have plenty of excuses \Nto march on the capital.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:27.04,0:02:29.12,Default,N,0,0,0,,Who was assassinated?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:29.61,0:02:32.14,Default,S,0,0,0,,I told you, Ashikaga Yoshiteru.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:32.14,0:02:34.75,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Ashikaga Yoshiteru hasn't \Nbeen assassinated.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.53,0:02:38.18,Default,A,0,0,0,,And it's a little {\i1}sister{\i0},\Nnot a brother.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:38.18,0:02:40.04,Default,S,0,0,0,,W-Wait a second.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.04,0:02:43.51,Default,S,0,0,0,,In the game, the Ashikaga get assassinated.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.27,0:02:46.52,Default,N,0,0,0,,They made it out by the \Nskin of their teeth,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.09,0:02:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and fled to the continent with \Ntheir little sister Lady Yoshiaki.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.77,0:02:53.28,Default,S,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.28,0:02:57.16,Default,S,0,0,0,,If history starts splitting \Noff from what I know,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.16,0:02:59.58,Default,S,0,0,0,,what good am I?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.29,0:03:04.28,Default,A,0,0,0,,Even monkeys fall from \Ntrees, Mister Monkey.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.28,0:03:08.72,Default,A,0,0,0,,{\q3}Okay! Since Mr. Sagara's monkey wisdom won't help us,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.72,0:03:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I{\i0} have a great idea.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.41,0:03:15.04,Default,A,0,0,0,,The captured Imagawa Yoshimoto
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.17,0:03:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,carries the blood of the Ashikaga clan and has the right to succeed.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.73,0:03:26.10,Default,A,0,0,0,,We march on the capital with \N{\i1}her{\i0} as the new ruler.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.93,0:03:30.38,Default,N,0,0,0,,Smart.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.38,0:03:33.10,Default,N,0,0,0,,I'm glad we made you one of our generals.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.49,0:03:37.66,Default,A,0,0,0,,I'll do my best to catch up \Nto and surpass Mr. Sagara.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.66,0:03:38.86,Default,N,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.31,0:03:42.24,Default,N,0,0,0,,The Oda armies will march on the capital!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.80,0:03:51.00,Default,I,0,0,0,,{\q3}On the way, we'll encounter the Asai and Rokkaku clans in Oumi!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.00,0:03:52.50,Default,I,0,0,0,,Stay sharp!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.00,0:03:56.50,Default,I,0,0,0,,You again?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.86,0:04:00.00,Default,N,0,0,0,,You don't know when to give up.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.00,0:04:03.41,Default,Na,0,0,0,,The Oda and Asai should \Nform an alliance.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.41,0:04:06.76,Default,Na,0,0,0,,You don't want to make \Nan enemy of us, do you?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.25,0:04:10.20,Default,N,0,0,0,,Don't I? What if we do?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.67,0:04:12.98,Default,N,0,0,0,,We won't care one bit.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.98,0:04:15.02,Default,N,0,0,0,,I'm sure {\i1}you{\i0} will, though!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.49,0:04:18.65,Default,N,0,0,0,,I mean, you {\i1}did{\i0} tell everyone\N we were to be wed, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.00,0:04:21.92,Default,N,0,0,0,,If that falls apart, all of \NJapan will laugh at you.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.92,0:04:23.65,Default,N,0,0,0,,Poor thing!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.65,0:04:27.60,Default,N,0,0,0,,Well, if you cry and beg, \Nmaybe I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.60,0:04:29.50,Default,Na,0,0,0,,Th-That's not...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.50,0:04:32.79,Default,N,0,0,0,,Then we're done here.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.12,0:04:34.68,Default,Na,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.68,0:04:37.42,Default,Na,0,0,0,,If I don't get married, \NI can't go back home!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.42,0:04:39.30,Default,Na,0,0,0,,Please, I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.01,0:04:45.05,Default,N,0,0,0,,Oh, fine. You can have my \Nlittle sister. Be grateful.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.49,0:04:46.62,Default,Na,0,0,0,,Little sister?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.62,0:04:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I hadn't heard anything about \Nyou having a little sister.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.93,0:04:53.45,Default,N,0,0,0,,Oh, I do! Believe me.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.45,0:04:55.81,Default,N,0,0,0,,If you start questioning me, the deal is off.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.81,0:04:59.82,Default,Na,0,0,0,,I will gladly take your sister!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.95,0:05:03.82,Default,N,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, Nobunaga\Ndid have a little sister,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.41,0:05:07.40,Default,N,0,0,0,,the beautiful Oichi.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.58,0:05:11.83,Default,Ns,0,0,0,,S-Sister, what is this?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.15,0:05:15.58,Default,N,0,0,0,,Congrats on your marriage!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.58,0:05:19.26,Default,N,0,0,0,,From now on, you're Asai Nagamasa's wife.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.26,0:05:20.59,Default,Ns,0,0,0,,Wife?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.18,0:05:23.59,Default,N,0,0,0,,Have a long and happy life together!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.59,0:05:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.09,0:05:28.91,Default,N,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.91,0:05:30.21,Default,S,0,0,0,,Horrible...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.21,0:05:31.66,Default,S,0,0,0,,You know that's fraud, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.66,0:05:33.35,Default,N,0,0,0,,What they don't know won't hurt them.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.69,0:05:36.12,Default,S,0,0,0,,You won't fool {\i1}me{\i0} like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.87,0:05:41.29,Default,S,0,0,0,,You promised I could have a beautiful \Ngirl as a reward if I conquered Mino.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.29,0:05:43.61,Default,N,0,0,0,,W-Well...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.98,0:05:46.58,Default,S,0,0,0,,If you don't give her to me,\NI won't work anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.58,0:05:47.66,Default,N,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.66,0:05:49.38,Default,S,0,0,0,,Give me the pretty girl!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.38,0:05:51.33,Default,N,0,0,0,,That's a stupid request.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.33,0:05:52.83,Default,N,0,0,0,,You really are shameless!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.83,0:05:54.37,Default,S,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.37,0:05:59.21,Default,S,0,0,0,,That's the only reason a \Nman would risk his life!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.57,0:06:00.71,Default,N,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.07,0:06:03.25,Default,S,0,0,0,,The prettiest girl in Japan. Okay?!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.25,0:06:05.21,Default,N,0,0,0,,I'll keep my promise.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.97,0:06:11.72,Default,N,0,0,0,,Tonight... clean yourself up and wait.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.73,0:06:21.36,Default,S,0,0,0,,Who could it be? Who could it be?!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.23,0:06:26.86,Default,I,0,0,0,,Y-You like my breasts... that much?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.93,0:06:33.49,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Your begging will get you... 100 points.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.35,0:06:39.71,Default,A,0,0,0,,Mr. Sagara, be gentle... please.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.52,0:06:44.08,Default,S,0,0,0,,Another excellent choice!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.27,0:06:48.55,Default,S,0,0,0,,But I think I'd rather have...\Nsomebody more elegant.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.55,0:06:49.80,Default,S,0,0,0,,Yoshimoto...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.22,0:06:57.31,Default,S,0,0,0,,No way... Nobuna?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.25,0:07:01.73,Default,S,0,0,0,,As if! She hates me!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.73,0:07:05.63,Default,S,0,0,0,,No, no! No, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.64,0:07:11.07,Default,N,0,0,0,,Why do I have to give myself to Monkey?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.54,0:07:15.15,Default,N,0,0,0,,Take your reward...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.15,0:07:17.86,Default,N,0,0,0,,the most beautiful girl in Japan.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.75,0:07:20.58,Default,S,0,0,0,,O-Oh, no!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.58,0:07:22.83,Default,S,0,0,0,,My heart's just not ready for it!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.61,0:07:28.76,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,Here's your reward from the princess!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.31,0:07:31.26,Default,S,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.75,0:07:35.96,Default,N,0,0,0,,Ta-da! Nene, the prettiest girl in Japan!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.96,0:07:39.18,Default,N,0,0,0,,From now on, I'll be your little sister!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.31,0:07:41.71,Default,N,0,0,0,,Be happy!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.71,0:07:44.19,Default,S,0,0,0,,Th-That woman...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.19,0:07:48.77,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,721)\t(3859,4568,\alpha&HFF&)}This is fraud!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.08,0:07:56.00,Default,Narr,0,0,0,,With Asai Nagamasa on her side,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.00,0:07:58.35,Default,Narr,0,0,0,,Nobuna advanced into southern Oumi.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.35,0:08:00.79,Default,Narr,0,0,0,,She defeated Rokkaku Joutei,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.79,0:08:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,and arrived just outside the capital, \Nthen known as Kyo.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.50,0:08:16.68,Default,N,0,0,0,,With all these brilliant generals, \NKyo is as good as ours!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.37,0:08:19.18,Default,N,0,0,0,,March!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.23,0:08:31.19,Default,S,0,0,0,,I was hoping to see a \NKyoto beauty or two,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.68,0:08:33.94,Default,S,0,0,0,,but the whole place is deserted.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.94,0:08:35.20,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Somebody!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.11,0:08:37.07,Default,S,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.81,0:08:43.56,Default,S,0,0,0,,Robbery in broad daylight?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.56,0:08:45.46,Default,H,0,0,0,,Those are Miyoshi soldiers.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.46,0:08:46.92,Default,S,0,0,0,,They were?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.92,0:08:48.71,Default,S,0,0,0,,Those were definitely bandits.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.69,0:08:51.34,Default,Bandits,0,0,0,,Out of the way!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.91,0:08:55.98,Default,H,0,0,0,,The collapse of Ashikaga's rule has\Nturned Kyoto into a lawless place.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.98,0:08:58.94,Default,S,0,0,0,,So, the reason Nobuna told \Nus to go investigate was...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.94,0:09:00.98,Default,H,0,0,0,,Kyo is the center of Japan.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.98,0:09:05.86,Default,H,0,0,0,,Maybe she wanted to see what a country\Nlooks like when it's lost its ruler.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.86,0:09:07.48,Default,S,0,0,0,,So that's what it was.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.49,0:09:11.75,Default,H,0,0,0,,Miss Goemon and I will \Ngather information.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.75,0:09:16.36,Default,H,0,0,0,,You go to Yamato Palace, \Nwhere Lady Himiko awaits.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.36,0:09:17.62,Default,S,0,0,0,,Himiko?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.43,0:09:22.50,Default,H,0,0,0,,She is the head of the Yamato court.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.90,0:09:26.80,Default,H,0,0,0,,She's said to be the descendant of \Nthe gods who built this nation,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.80,0:09:29.50,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,932)\t(1808,2726,\alpha&HFF&)}and is worshiped as such.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.50,0:09:33.63,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's a little different \Nthan my world.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.89,0:09:40.22,Default,S,0,0,0,,Hey, jerkwads!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.30,0:09:42.77,Default,I,0,0,0,,This time you won't get away!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.59,0:09:48.71,Default,S,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.71,0:09:49.82,Default,S,0,0,0,,You're not hurt, are you?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.45,0:09:51.78,Default,Hi,0,0,0,,I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.39,0:09:55.68,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}This girl has a strange aura.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.36,0:09:58.32,Default,Hi,0,0,0,,It's dangerous here.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.32,0:09:59.87,Default,S,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.35,0:10:04.08,Default,S,0,0,0,,We should get away from here.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.57,0:10:15.71,Default,Ko,0,0,0,,What were you thinking?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.71,0:10:18.53,Default,Ko,0,0,0,,Attacking the palace?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.53,0:10:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Such insolence will not stand!
