Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.25,0:11:40.76,Default,M,0,0,0,,To us, Lady Himiko is \Nan important puppet.{I think puppet makes more sense here than doll. -GBF}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.31,0:11:47.07,Default,N,0,0,0,,And there's Mitsukuri Castle.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.07,0:11:48.39,Default,N,0,0,0,,We're looking good.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.72,0:11:51.47,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,A simultaneous attack \Non all the castles...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.47,0:11:54.64,Default,A,0,0,0,,Rokkaku must've been surprised!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.64,0:11:57.70,Default,N,0,0,0,,We've got lots of great generals.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.70,0:11:59.65,Default,N,0,0,0,,No sense in wasting our time.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.65,0:12:01.54,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,A brilliant plan.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.54,0:12:03.03,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Ninety-five points.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.37,0:12:08.79,Default,A,0,0,0,,Mr. Sagara must be really upset\Nthat he couldn't get any glory.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.17,0:12:10.34,Default,N,0,0,0,,That's just fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.34,0:12:12.48,Default,N,0,0,0,,Kyo is more important.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.48,0:12:15.00,Default,N,0,0,0,,Looks like things are pretty bad there.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.00,0:12:16.76,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Are you worried?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.95,0:12:19.31,Default,N,0,0,0,,N-Not at all!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.31,0:12:20.82,Default,N,0,0,0,,Hanbei and Goemon are there.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.82,0:12:22.38,Default,N,0,0,0,,He'll be fine!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.95,0:12:27.78,Default,N,0,0,0,,Let's mop up the Rokkaku!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:43.92,0:12:45.20,Default,Hi,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.81,0:12:53.62,Default,S,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe this is Kyoto.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.57,0:12:56.79,Default,Hi,0,0,0,,Is it different in your world?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.16,0:13:01.30,Default,B,0,0,0,,Stay back, thugs!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.86,0:13:03.30,Default,B,0,0,0,,Or taste my ultimate move:
Dialogue: 10,0:13:03.87,0:13:08.51,Default,B,0,0,0,,"Bontenmaru Wants to Be \NLike That Too Super-Sword!"
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.15,0:13:10.26,Default,L,0,0,0,,You mustn't.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.52,0:13:12.06,Default,B,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.89,0:13:16.85,Default,S,0,0,0,,Whoa! A European nun!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.85,0:13:20.69,Default,S,0,0,0,,Blonde hair and big boobs! \NNow that's an awesome combo!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.59,0:13:22.69,Default,I,0,0,0,,You're scum.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:23.05,0:13:25.95,Default,L,0,0,0,,Violence cannot heal suffering.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.88,0:13:28.40,Default,L,0,0,0,,Let us pray.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:28.40,0:13:30.70,Default,L,0,0,0,,Love thine enemy.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.70,0:13:35.62,Default,Thugs,0,0,0,,Then come on and love us.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.62,0:13:38.96,Default,Thugs,0,0,0,,I've never had a foreign girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.89,0:13:41.25,Default,L,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.42,0:13:43.30,Default,Hi,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.89,0:13:48.14,Default,Hi,0,0,0,,As men of the land of the rising sun,\Nyou should be ashamed.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:48.58,0:13:50.36,Default,Thug,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.36,0:13:53.06,Default,Thug,0,0,0,,Get lost, kid!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:56.23,0:13:57.69,Default,B,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.69,0:14:00.60,Default,B,0,0,0,,I, Bontenmaru, won't fall behind!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.68,0:14:15.51,Default,M,0,0,0,,Found you.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.55,0:14:21.38,Default,L,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.38,0:14:26.13,Default,L,0,0,0,,I am Louise Frois, a \Nmissionary from Portugal.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.47,0:14:28.53,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'm Sagara Yoshiharu.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.53,0:14:29.42,Default,I,0,0,0,,Inuchiyo.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.42,0:14:31.85,Default,B,0,0,0,,I am the Demon King of Destruction.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:31.85,0:14:34.74,Default,B,0,0,0,,The beast of the apocalypse:
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.74,0:14:36.43,Default,B,0,0,0,,Bontenmaru!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:38.86,0:14:40.21,Default,S,0,0,0,,Sure you are.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.21,0:14:42.02,Default,S,0,0,0,,Anyway, sorry about what happened.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.02,0:14:43.32,Default,S,0,0,0,,You've come to Kyoto \Nfor missionary work?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.81,0:14:44.88,Default,L,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.88,0:14:47.74,Default,L,0,0,0,,Normally I stay in the \Nforeign quarters in Sakai,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.17,0:14:52.33,Default,L,0,0,0,,but I had hoped the court would allow\Nme to take my mission throughout Japan.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.33,0:14:54.99,Default,L,0,0,0,,I was turned away, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.99,0:14:56.54,Default,Hi,0,0,0,,You were?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.83,0:15:01.55,Default,L,0,0,0,,Europeans are not allowed \Nnear the court, they said.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.55,0:15:02.88,Default,I,0,0,0,,That's awful.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.43,0:15:06.88,Default,L,0,0,0,,I wanted to meet Lady Himiko.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.85,0:15:09.33,Default,Hi,0,0,0,,Why's that?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.33,0:15:12.42,Default,L,0,0,0,,As a fellow servant of God,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.42,0:15:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,235)}I thought she would understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.98,0:15:17.18,Default,L,0,0,0,,{\fad(558,0)}To end the wars,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:17.18,0:15:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and make a nation where \Neveryone can live happily.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.55,0:15:23.15,Default,L,0,0,0,,That is God's wish.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.15,0:15:26.52,Default,L,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,472)}And it's my dream.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.01,0:15:29.76,Default,S,0,0,0,,Your dream will come true.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.59,0:15:33.07,Default,L,0,0,0,,Mr. Yoshiharu.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.07,0:15:35.94,Default,S,0,0,0,,As long as you don't \Ngive up, it'll happen.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.33,0:15:39.58,Default,S,0,0,0,,It might sound naive,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.93,0:15:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's what I believe.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.89,0:15:45.40,Default,L,0,0,0,,Yes, so do I.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.09,0:15:48.84,Default,N,0,0,0,,All that's left is Kannonji Castle.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.29,0:15:51.36,Default,K,0,0,0,,Let's take it immediately.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.36,0:15:54.22,Default,N,0,0,0,,No, send out a request \Nfor their surrender.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.22,0:15:56.22,Default,A,0,0,0,,I can't imagine they'll agree!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.22,0:15:59.12,Default,N,0,0,0,,Tell them to run if they \Ndon't want to surrender.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.12,0:16:00.92,Default,N,0,0,0,,We won't chase after them.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.92,0:16:02.90,Default,A,0,0,0,,Run?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.76,0:16:08.24,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,That sounds just like you.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.24,0:16:10.74,Default,A,0,0,0,,I've never heard anything like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:11.27,0:16:13.74,Default,N,0,0,0,,We just have to get to the capital.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.24,0:16:17.14,Default,N,0,0,0,,There's no need to shed \Nblood unnecessarily.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.09,0:16:20.24,Default,Ko,0,0,0,,Those Rokkaku fools!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.91,0:16:26.92,Default,Ko,0,0,0,,They should've fought to the\Nlast man and delayed Oda Nobuna!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.92,0:16:30.72,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,The Rokkaku have fled into \Nthe Kouga mountains, I hear.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.72,0:16:33.31,Default,Ak,0,0,0,,Could they be any more pathetic?
