Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.77,0:16:43.84,Default,Ak,0,0,0,,The fool princess marching on the capital?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.84,0:16:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,These are dark times indeed.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.71,0:16:48.68,Default,Ko,0,0,0,,If a country countess like\N Imagawa Yoshimoto takes rule,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.68,0:16:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,everything we've done\Nwill be for naught.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.30,0:16:53.90,Default,Ak,0,0,0,,Yoshimoto?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:54.26,0:16:59.44,Default,Ak,0,0,0,,I'd love to make her mine \Nand add her to my work.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.51,0:17:03.41,Default,Tsu,0,0,0,,You have quite the hobby.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.41,0:17:09.00,Default,Ak,0,0,0,,Especially since some idiots let\Nthe Ashikagas' little sister escape.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.00,0:17:11.00,Default,Miyoshi,0,0,0,,Do you dare mock us?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.00,0:17:12.46,Default,Ak,0,0,0,,If you don't like it,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.46,0:17:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,you may battle Echizen \NAsakura's army of 750,000.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.61,0:17:20.68,Default,Ts,0,0,0,,Infighting won't earn us a thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:20.68,0:17:22.90,Default,Ko,0,0,0,,That's exactly right.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.90,0:17:24.23,Default,Ko,0,0,0,,With the Miyoshi and Asakura,{WHY CAN'T...}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.23,0:17:26.69,Default,Ko,0,0,0,,if the Takeda and Uesugi\Njoin us against Nobuna,{...CRUNCHYROLL...}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.69,0:17:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,she will be completely surrounded.{...TIME?!}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:29.69,0:17:32.55,Default,Shou,0,0,0,,But that will take time.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.55,0:17:35.31,Default,Shou,0,0,0,,Nobuna will make it to the capital first.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.03,0:17:41.56,Default,Ak,0,0,0,,We will withdraw our men for\Nnow and set fire to Kyo.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.56,0:17:43.21,Default,Ak,0,0,0,,If it delays her advance,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.21,0:17:46.20,Default,Ak,0,0,0,,then my forces, Takeda, and\NUesugi will get there in time.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.20,0:17:47.21,Default,Ko,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.65,0:17:50.07,Default,Ko,0,0,0,,We're counting on you, Miyoshi Three!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.07,0:17:51.96,Default,Miyoshi,0,0,0,,On us, sir?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.34,0:17:54.67,Default,Ko,0,0,0,,You have Matsunaga Danjo, as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:54.67,0:17:58.37,Default,Ko,0,0,0,,{\q3}Fight Nobuna, even if you must battle to the last man.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.37,0:17:59.93,Default,Miyoshi,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.31,0:18:03.02,Default,Ak,0,0,0,,I'll send reinforcements.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.14,0:18:07.18,Default,Ak,0,0,0,,A man who hates Nobuna \Nmore than anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.18,0:18:09.14,Default,Ak,0,0,0,,He'll be useful.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.03,0:18:25.88,Default,S,0,0,0,,You should head home.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.88,0:18:28.04,Default,Hi,0,0,0,,This place is the worst in Kyo.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.09,0:18:32.13,Default,Hi,0,0,0,,I wanted to see it for myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.09,0:18:41.93,Default,Hi,0,0,0,,The people are suffering. I had to\Ngo outside to see just how much.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.96,0:18:44.43,Default,Hi,0,0,0,,Regardless of the future,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.86,0:18:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,this hell is reality right now.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.94,0:18:51.54,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Does she know...\NI've come from the future?{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:53.49,0:18:56.84,Default,Hi,0,0,0,,Will there ever be a world \Nwhere the people can be happy?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.61,0:19:02.86,Default,S,0,0,0,,Sure there will.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.86,0:19:04.70,Default,Hi,0,0,0,,How can you be sure?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.70,0:19:06.89,Default,S,0,0,0,,Because of Oda Nobuna.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.89,0:19:11.12,Default,S,0,0,0,,If she unites Japan,\Nshe'll make a new world.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.12,0:19:12.51,Default,Hi,0,0,0,,Oda Nobuna?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:14.17,0:19:15.85,Default,Hi,0,0,0,,A world where everyone can be happy,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.85,0:19:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,where we can be friends \Nwith Europeans like Frois.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.02,0:19:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,A world where everything is peaceful.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.25,0:19:22.72,Default,Hi,0,0,0,,Nobuna can make it happen.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.05,0:19:25.14,Default,Hi,0,0,0,,Is that her dream?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.14,0:19:27.54,Default,S,0,0,0,,Her dream is {\i1}everyone's{\i0} dream.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.54,0:19:31.40,Default,S,0,0,0,,And if you don't give up on \Nyour dream, it will come true.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:39.40,0:19:40.56,Default,S,0,0,0,,What is this?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.78,0:19:49.33,Default,S,0,0,0,,My head... I don't feel well...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:00.35,0:20:02.25,Default,M,0,0,0,,I am Matsunaga Danjo.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.25,0:20:04.22,Default,M,0,0,0,,I've come for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:04.71,0:20:06.90,Default,Hi,0,0,0,,You've come to take me back?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.90,0:20:12.28,Default,M,0,0,0,,I'll tell them all that you \Nwere kidnapped by bandits.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:14.05,0:20:15.98,Default,Hi,0,0,0,,Do not touch them!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.35,0:20:17.98,Default,Hi,0,0,0,,I'll go back quietly.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.98,0:20:19.61,Default,Hi,0,0,0,,That should be good enough.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.77,0:20:24.80,Default,M,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.40,0:20:38.25,Default,S,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.25,0:20:41.07,Default,G,0,0,0,,I've been looking for you, Sagara!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.07,0:20:42.32,Default,S,0,0,0,,Goemon.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.32,0:20:43.54,Default,S,0,0,0,,Hanbei!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.58,0:20:46.84,Default,H,0,0,0,,This presence...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.84,0:20:49.24,Default,H,0,0,0,,Were you attacked by a \Nsupernatural creature?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.97,0:20:51.82,Default,S,0,0,0,,I don't know what happened.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.39,0:20:53.89,Default,S,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.31,0:20:55.61,Default,Hi,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.19,0:21:01.38,Default,S,0,0,0,,You sure this is far enough?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:01.38,0:21:02.87,Default,Hi,0,0,0,,You've done so much already.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.85,0:21:11.92,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}What an odd girl.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.92,0:21:14.36,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe she's some shrine priestess?{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:17.51,0:21:20.26,Default,Hi,0,0,0,,Yoshiharu. Today was great fun.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:20.26,0:21:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We thank you from the bottom of our heart.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.55,0:21:26.05,Default,S,0,0,0,,We?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:26.89,0:21:29.55,Default,S,0,0,0,,Are you... Lady Himiko?{How does he arrive at this conclusion? -GBF}{fuck knows}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:31.39,0:21:35.18,Default,S,0,0,0,,And so Oda Nobuna \Nreached the capital at last,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.52,0:21:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and Kyo fell under the \Ncontrol of the Oda clan.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:42.56,0:21:46.66,Default,N,0,0,0,,I restored law and order in the \Ncapital, as you said I should.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.66,0:21:48.70,Default,N,0,0,0,,Looks like it was really bad.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:49.05,0:21:52.54,Default,S,0,0,0,,Yeah. I think it'll be a little better now.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:52.54,0:21:53.70,Default,S,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.70,0:21:55.64,Default,N,0,0,0,,It was nothing special.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:56.41,0:21:59.30,Default,S,0,0,0,,There are still lots of bad spots, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:59.30,0:22:02.38,Default,N,0,0,0,,That's just until I unite Japan.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:06.59,0:22:07.87,Default,S,0,0,0,,Hey, Nobuna.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:10.62,0:22:12.66,Default,S,0,0,0,,Let's make a peaceful country.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:15.68,0:22:16.58,Default,N,0,0,0,,Yeah.
